{"src":"ko","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":176700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ko","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10159.769812,"text":"만약 내셔널 트레저라는 영화를 봤다면 아마 독립선언서의 뒷면에 보물 지도가 쓰여졌다고 생각할지도 모른다."},{"kind":"text","t":11166.831719,"text":"If you have seen the movie National Treasure, you might think that a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":11288.435436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11293.368034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11298.36737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11303.715821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":11308.988344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11314.275576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11315.83606,"samples":15792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":16662.232927,"text":"핫초콜릿은 벨기에 표준에 따릅니다. 과일저스는 비싸지만 아주 맛있습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":17188.735378,"text":"Hot chocolate follows Belgian standards. Fruit juice is expensive, but it is very delicious."},{"kind":"audio","t":17297.40103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17302.653713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":17303.538328,"samples":11864,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":17369.299614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":17374.493768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17379.081721,"samples":31064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":26598.617895,"text":"하지만 그것은 사실이 아닙니다. 서류 뒷면에 뭔가 적힌 게 있더라도 이건 보물 지도가 아닙니다."},{"kind":"text","t":27436.490056,"text":"But that is not true. Even if there is something written on the back of the document, this is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":27531.267979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27533.195807,"samples":18232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"audio","t":27616.954604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27622.289575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27627.343131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27632.682812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":27633.239503,"samples":9328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":35338.522247,"text":"자신의 의견이 아닌 정부의 의견을 듣고 싶을 수도 있지만 각국 정부의 조언들은 자국민에 맞춰져 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":36525.885964,"text":"You may want to hear the government's opinion rather than their own, but the advice of each country's government is tailored to its own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":36719.941586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36721.439431000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36722.822258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36724.478561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":36726.088754000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36727.670437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36728.599952000004,"samples":27192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":43781.963342,"text":"홍콩섬은 홍콩 영토에 홍콩이라는 이름을 부여한 곳이자 많은 관광객들이 주안점으로 여기는 곳이다."},{"kind":"text","t":44880.317350000005,"text":"Hong Kong Island is the place that gave the name \"Hong Kong\" to the territory and is a primary point of interest for many tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":45004.305787000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45009.506161000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45014.446328000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"au